  "description": "Stripe billing adapter: webhook signature verification and canonical event mapping.\n      Deliberately implemented with only BCL/ASP.NET Core shared-framework APIs (HttpClient,\n      System.Security.Cryptography, System.Text.Json) instead of the Stripe.net package, so this\n      project restores and builds with zero NuGet access - see the EfCore infrastructure project's\n      description for why that matters in this sandbox. Swap in Stripe.net later if its higher-level\n      API surface is preferred; the adapter interface (IBillingProviderAdapter) would not change.",
